    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ラグナ遺跡</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Laguna Ruins</EnglishText>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <JapaneseText>すごい････　すごいよ　&lt;Loni&gt;！
こんな大きなレンズ見たの
生まれて初めてだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Amazing... Look, &lt;Loni&gt;!
That's the biggest lens
I've seen in my life.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <JapaneseText>俺もや　&lt;Kyle&gt;
こりゃ夢やあらへんやろな････」</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Me too, &lt;Kyle&gt;
It's like a dream....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <JapaneseText>いつまでも
突っ立ってても　しょうがあらへん
問題はこいつを
どうやって持って帰るか････</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This lens has been
sitting here forever.
It's a shame, 
we'll have to move it....</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <JapaneseText>う　うおっ････!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, Oh no....!!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたの　&lt;Loni&gt;？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's wrong, &lt;Loni&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <JapaneseText>い　いま
レンズの中に　なんかおった！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's okay.
There's something in the Lens!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <JapaneseText>レンズの中にぃ？
光の具合で
そう見えただけじゃないの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In the Lens?
That light.
Did you just see that?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <JapaneseText>気ぃつけろ　&lt;Kyle&gt;！
罠がしかけられてるのかもしれん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Be careful, &lt;Kyle&gt;!
It might be a trap!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <JapaneseText>ハハッ　だいじょうぶだって　ほら</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It should be safe.</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <JapaneseText>うわあぁっ!!
な　なんだ････!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wow!!
W What....!?</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <JapaneseText>あぶない！
ふせろ　&lt;Kyle&gt;っ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's dangerous!
Get back &lt;Kyle&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
